        {
          "type": "turn_end",
          "turn": {
            "text": "Alberto builds agents with a focus on reliability and safety:\n\n- **Offline evals before shipping**: He records agent cases against real models and replays them in CI, with no model or network access—stale recordings or off-topic leaks fail the build.\n\n- **Graded autonomy with human-in-the-loop**: For example, his fraud detection agent recommends actions but a human admin makes the final decision; it only auto-approves on evidence verified in code.\n\n- **Cost and limits tracked**: He uses token budgets per request, per-IP rate limits, and monthly spend caps. Every eval report shows mean tokens and latency per case.\n\n- **Changes measured run over run**: Each eval run appends metrics to a history, so any change to prompts, tools or content that affects performance is immediately visible.",
            "toolCalls": [],
            "stopReason": "end_turn",
